SUMMARY:'Rise and Shine' AMC Sunday Ecstatic Dance w/ DJ Kristikka
DESCRIPTION:Asheville Movement Collective\nSunday\, June 15th\n\n1st Dance
  Wave 8:30\\-10:30am \\| Warmup 8:30am \\| Opening Circle 9am\n2nd Dance W
 ave 10:30\\-12:30am \\| Warmup 10:30am \\| Opening Circle 11am\nDJ Kristik
 ka\n\nIntention: Rise and Shine\n\nAs we draw closer to the Summer Solstic
 e—the longest day of light—there is an invitation to shine like the su
 n without holding back. Connect and project your radiance. Rise and dance 
 from your essence. Allow light to move into any place within that longs fo
 r tenderness\, healing\, or renewal. Let the music move through you like s
 unlight through a forest\, illuminating what is ready to awaken.\n\nTogeth
 er\, we will create hundreds of points of light\, sparkling throughout our
  dance temple. With every step\, every breath\, every joyful expression\, 
 we dissolve a little more heaviness and remember the simple miracle of bei
 ng alive. Come shine like the sun. Come add your light to the collective g
 low.\n\nAbout DJ Kristikka\nKristikka (Kris Hostikka) loves creating a sac
 red container that takes you on an inward journey utilizing rhythm to move
  us from quiet embodiment to chaos and down into stillness and integration
 . She feels that movement is medicine\, weaving intention and a rich blend
  of world beats where it’s possible to be with what is and open to what 
 wants to be seen\, felt and moved. You can find her dance mixes here:[ ](h
 ttp://soundcloud.com/dj-kristikka) [http://soundcloud.com/dj-kristikka](ht
 tp://soundcloud.com/dj-kristikka)\n\n\\~\\~\\~\n\\*\\* Please note that th
 e dance starts at Warm up. The doors close promptly at Opening Circle and 
 people who arrive late will be turned away. Please be on time to ensure a 
 safe and secure container. \\*\\*\n\nTicket Price: $15-30 or name your pri
 ce.\nNo one turned away for lack of funds!\n\n\\~\\~\\~\n\nPre-registratio
 n Recommended:\nhttps://ashevillemovementcollective.org/event/\n\nVOLUNTEE
 R!\nWe need volunteers. Volunteer and dance for free! Register to voluntee
 r at: [https://ashevillemovementcollective.org/volunteer/](https://ashevil
 lemovementcollective.org/volunteer/?fbclid=IwZXh0bgNhZW0CMTAAYnJpZBExVTF6a
 ExURExqbndxM3JFUHNydGMGYXBwX2lkEDIyMjAzOTE3ODgyMDA4OTIAAR6puHJaet_dJGFESCI
 tA4rMD5vM_RHt9QzUSALulddRTAtGKexRuWuiBE8tDw_aem_vXP_JSWUu1NrAFuKa--PQA)\n\
 nIMPORTANT ANNOUNCEMENTS:\nDoor will close at the beginning of the opening
  circle. Please note: NO ENTRY AFTER OPENING CIRCLE BOTH WAVES!\n\nCollect
 ive agreements:\n[https://ashevillemovementcollective.org/our-dance/](http
 s://ashevillemovementcollective.org/our-dance/?fbclid=IwZXh0bgNhZW0CMTAAYn
 JpZBExVTF6aExURExqbndxM3JFUHNydGMGYXBwX2lkEDIyMjAzOTE3ODgyMDA4OTIAAR5CSyB7
 238bGlkEsU_Cg_jsh0446YHLe69W1y3KV5-T6oMaN-7Z3q32wDznUA_aem_wUhim1G2JnrnWxI
 QYKCcIA)\n\nAbout AMC:\nAsheville Movement Collective envisions a world th
 at moves in harmony where all are free to be their authentic selves within
  a loving community. Our mission and aim are to inspire authenticity and h
 ealthy community through free-form dance by hosting dance waves for person
 al and community transformation. AMC is a 501(c)(3) nonprofit organization
 .\n\nSee you on the dance floor!
